# Algorithmic dual-language environment

Dual-language high-speed testing environment for Algorithms and Data Structures.

## Specifications

- **TypeScript**: Executed via \`bun\`. To test: \`bun test <algorithm>\`
- **Python**: Executed via \`uv\` and \`pytest\`. To test: \`uv run pytest <algorithm>\`

